+                "### Contents in _Practical_\n",
+                "\n",
+                "* Import and draw molecules\n",
+                "* Calculate molecular descriptors\n",
+                "  * 1D molecular descriptors: Molecular weight\n",
+                "  * 2D molecular descriptors: MACCS fingerprint\n",
